msgid "Activity ranking plugin"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​កំណត់​ជួរ​សកម្មភាព"

#: service/plugins/activityranking/activitymanager-plugin-activityranking.desktop:32
msgctxt "Comment"
